---
import Module8Behold from './Module8Behold';
import Module8Derive from './Module8Derive';
import Module8Orbifold from './Module8Orbifold';
import Module8Operate from './Module8Operate';
import Module8Prompts from './Module8Prompts';
---

<div class="m m8">
  <section class="m-block m8-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">behold</p>
    <p>
      Tymoczko's claim: the most efficient voice leading between two
      chords is the <em>shortest path</em> in a curved geometric space —
      the orbifold T<sup>n</sup>/S<sub>n</sub>. The full geometry is
      hard to draw on a screen. The consequence is easy: for any two
      chords, compute the assignment of voices that minimizes total
      motion, and that <em>is</em> the geodesic.
    </p>
    <Module8Behold client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m8-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">derive</p>
    <p>
      Pick any two diatonic triads and the table shows which voice
      goes where for minimum total motion. The cheapest possible
      transition between two consonant triads is{' '}
      <strong>one semitone</strong> total — and exactly the chord
      pairs that achieve that one-semitone cost are the chords
      connected by P, L, or R. Module 7's transformations were
      already telling you about the orbifold's edges.
    </p>
    <Module8Derive client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m8-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">geometry</p>
    <p>
      Now the picture instead of the table. The space of unordered
      two-note chords (dyads) is a <em>Möbius strip</em> — Tymoczko's
      cleanest example, with the diagonal as the unison wall where
      both voices coincide. Pick two dyads; the line between them is
      the voice leading. If the optimal assignment crosses voices,
      the path doesn't go through the wall — it <em>reflects</em>
      off it. That reflection is what makes the orbifold curved.
    </p>
    <Module8Orbifold client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m8-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">operate</p>
    <p>
      Hear the voice leading. The piano holds the source chord, then
      the target chord; the voices that don't move sit still in the
      sound, while the voice that does move shifts cleanly. The
      smaller the total semitone cost, the more the two chords feel
      like one prolonged sound rather than a leap.
    </p>
    <Module8Operate client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m8-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">prompt</p>
    <p class="m-prompt-intro">
      Two cards on the metric and the geodesic.
    </p>
    <Module8Prompts client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m8-block m-bridge m8-bridge">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">bridge</p>
    <p>
      We've been treating tonality as structure. But a real listener
      doesn't know the key in advance — they <em>infer</em> it from
      the pitches they hear. Next: a statistical view, where the key
      is the maximum-likelihood explanation of a pc distribution.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<style is:global>
  /* Module 8 specific rules. */

  .m8-behold,
  .m8-derive,
  .m8-operate {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    max-width: 440px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Voice-leading table — shared between Behold and Derive ------------- */
  .m8-vl-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .m8-vl-chord {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .m8-vl-arrow-big {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m8-vl-table {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    min-width: 16rem;
  }
  .m8-vl-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .m8-vl-pitch {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .m8-arrow {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .m8-arrow.stay {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m8-vl-cost {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .m8-vl-cost-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m8-vl-cost-value {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m8-behold-caption,
  .m8-derive-caption,
  .m8-operate-caption {
    font-size: 0.92rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
    max-width: 44ch;
  }
  .m8-behold-caption em,
  .m8-derive-caption em {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Pair picker (Derive + Operate) ------------------------------------- */
  .m8-pair-pickers {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m8-picker-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  .m8-picker-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m8-picker-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m8-picker-btn {
    min-width: 2.3rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m8-picker-btn:hover:not(.active):not(:disabled) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m8-picker-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m8-picker-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: default;
  }

  /* Orbifold ----------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m8-orbifold {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .m8-orbifold svg {
    background: #f5efe0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .m8-orb-pickers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
  .m8-orb-picker {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.65rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .m8-orb-picker-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m8-orb-voice {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .m8-orb-voice-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    width: 1.6rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .m8-orb-pc-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .m8-orb-pc {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    min-width: 1.7rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.3rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m8-orb-pc:hover:not(.active) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m8-orb-pc.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m8-orb-readout {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .m8-orb-kind {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }
  .m8-orb-kind-parallel {
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .m8-orb-kind-crossed {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m8-orb-cost {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m8-orb-caption {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
    max-width: 50ch;
  }
  .m8-orb-caption em {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m8-orb-caption-aside {
    font-size: 0.8rem !important;
    color: var(--text-muted) !important;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .m8-orb-pickers {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* Operate play button ------------------------------------------------ */
  .m8-operate-play {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .m8-operate-play:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m8-operate-play:disabled {
    cursor: default;
    background: var(--bg-button);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    border-color: var(--border);
  }
  .m8-operate-caption strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
